 ### Greedy proposal matching
-A fast assignment strategy used during Phase 1 to compute the L2 matching loss between heuristic samples and learnt proposals. For each heuristic sample, find the closest proposal from the learnt proposer set. Optimal matching (Hungarian algorithm) or strict 1-1 greedy matching significantly slows training [S12, unofficial].
